  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wr 101.45\n\n#10508, eff 1-22-14\n\nThe prior filings affecting the deleted rule Env-Wr 102.01 titled “Summary of Duties” in Part Env-Wr 102 included the following documents:\n\n#1716, eff 2-20-81\n\n#2207, eff 12-13-82\n\n#2900, eff 11-7-84, EXPIRED 11-7-90\n\n#5080, eff 2-22-91\n\n#6462-A, eff 2-21-97\n\n#8288, INTERIM, eff 2-21-05\n\n#8412, eff 8-20-05\n\n#10508, eff 1-22-14\n\nThe prior filings affecting the deleted rule Env-Wr 103.01 titled “Public Records: Access to Files” in Part Env-Wr 103 included the following documents:\n\n#1716, eff 2-20-81\n\n#2207, eff 12-13-82\n\n#2900, eff 11-7-84\n\n#4278, eff 6-30-87\n\n#4580, eff 2-27-89\n\n#5080, eff 2-22-91\n\n#6462-A, eff 2-21-97 (formerly Env-Wr 105.01)\n\n#8288, INTERIM, eff 2-21-05\n\n#8412, eff 8-20-05\n\n#10508, eff 1-22-14\n\nAs organizational and practice and procedure rules, the rules in Document #13979 will not expire except pursuant to RSA 541-A:17, II.",
